            {
                "entry_id": "5043e740-ae40-3cfc-9566-d6e477bad04d",
                "word": "importation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f9a56742-d19d-4444-b0bb-4b368292c44f",
                        "entry_id": "5043e740-ae40-3cfc-9566-d6e477bad04d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "importations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f578bdf2-9445-3ba2-a095-0ec6f3563516",
                        "entry_id": "5043e740-ae40-3cfc-9566-d6e477bad04d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action d’importer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "302fb218-d824-4e08-9fc2-bac989deea6f",
                                "sense_id": "f578bdf2-9445-3ba2-a095-0ec6f3563516",
                                "text": "Ces derniers jugent déloyales les importations de tomates iraniennes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e794ac7-d364-407e-932f-e5908d690b83",
                                "sense_id": "f578bdf2-9445-3ba2-a095-0ec6f3563516",
                                "text": "La société Funboard importe des planches à roulettes de Corée et de Taïwan selon les modèles. La dernière commande concerne l’importation de 8 000 planches à roulettes au prix unitaire de 100 USD CIF Le Havre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c1759c4-8bc0-4171-afc7-031339d8d4c9",
                                "sense_id": "f578bdf2-9445-3ba2-a095-0ec6f3563516",
                                "text": "— Faudra-t-il donc, écrit Jules Marouzeau à propos du français, chaque fois que nous pratiquons une importation, avoir recours pour la désigner à quelque procédé périphrastique ? C’est ce que nous avons fait, après quelles hésitations ! pour le mot pomme de terre."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "62f056fc-2cc9-335b-aaba-fda3e891190c",
                        "entry_id": "5043e740-ae40-3cfc-9566-d6e477bad04d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Marchandises importées."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "adf6e244-712f-4db4-b917-2b1db88836ec",
                                "sense_id": "62f056fc-2cc9-335b-aaba-fda3e891190c",
                                "text": "Si l'on prend comme exemple l'approvisionnement alimentaire, on entend par autosuffisance une complète indépendance à l'égard des importations pour répondre aux besoins alimentaires d'une collectivité ou d'une ville, un objectif difficilement atteignable même en vertu du scénario le plus optimiste."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e50f530-24bc-4b69-8124-b08d36347e47",
                                "sense_id": "62f056fc-2cc9-335b-aaba-fda3e891190c",
                                "text": "Les importations ont été beaucoup moins considérables que les exportations."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dd15a0bc-2043-3e70-9339-1caf2b072755",
                        "entry_id": "5043e740-ae40-3cfc-9566-d6e477bad04d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Transport d’un pays dans un autre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "analogy"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "81c30532-745e-4326-985e-4f901c56c640",
                                "sense_id": "dd15a0bc-2043-3e70-9339-1caf2b072755",
                                "text": "Ce constat n’est pas nouveau : le keynésiano-fordisme des Trente Glorieuses s’est bâti sur le recours massif à l’importation de travailleurs immigrés venus du Tiers monde."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f734908b-1267-4bfd-9c0b-b74f55ecebcb",
                                "sense_id": "dd15a0bc-2043-3e70-9339-1caf2b072755",
                                "text": "L’importation du choléra en Europe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f7836f5-6022-4e40-8c8b-05208eea6a0b",
                                "sense_id": "dd15a0bc-2043-3e70-9339-1caf2b072755",
                                "text": "L’importation de modes étrangères. — L’importation d’idées subversives."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "37a27128-c906-4060-973f-fc03bdd2ac47",
                        "source_entry_id": "5043e740-ae40-3cfc-9566-d6e477bad04d",
                        "target_lang_word": "import",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "import",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c97b64d5-88ff-3308-b187-6507681cf1fd",
                                        "entry_id": "d8fb1ba5-f16f-3193-8cef-4be37187c941",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something brought in from an exterior source, especially for sale or trade."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ad4303d-a729-4274-ba8e-4a9c873bb86c",
                                                "sense_id": "c97b64d5-88ff-3308-b187-6507681cf1fd",
                                                "text": "Trump’s July 8 announcement of a 50% tariff on copper imports beginning August 1 sent prices surging 13% in one day, up to a record high of $5.69 per pound."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "19c6fd26-1caa-3ea3-953a-e1ff5c00adf3",
                                        "entry_id": "d8fb1ba5-f16f-3193-8cef-4be37187c941",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The practice of importing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96a8d123-52f1-39ba-b44a-c4a6b2d715aa",
                                        "entry_id": "d8fb1ba5-f16f-3193-8cef-4be37187c941",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Clipping of importance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "clipping",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3aea1ed7-a099-4fb2-8d94-861d7b8b03cb",
                                                "sense_id": "96a8d123-52f1-39ba-b44a-c4a6b2d715aa",
                                                "text": "It was a matter of great import."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e721858-8c46-4b33-bae4-887954ba74a6",
                                                "sense_id": "96a8d123-52f1-39ba-b44a-c4a6b2d715aa",
                                                "text": "There is, too, a little mentioned aspect of the tunnel which contributes to its failings. You never see the sea while approaching it from either the British or French side. That takes away from the import of the journey - a historic link between Britain and the continent. Instead, it is just a tunnel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "656e1093-bb89-3f10-8a84-ae3f472f8711",
                                        "entry_id": "d8fb1ba5-f16f-3193-8cef-4be37187c941",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A foreigner playing in a sports league."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Philippines",
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "import",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65f449d6-625f-37d7-9501-af68a5964756",
                                        "entry_id": "4a2d3e8a-a0a5-3ff3-8953-de100ff192ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bring (something) in from a foreign country, especially for sale or trade."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02177014-ad38-4621-816b-f392458fd2d6",
                                                "sense_id": "65f449d6-625f-37d7-9501-af68a5964756",
                                                "text": "Nauru imports foods from Australia because phosphate mining destroyed land for farming."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56028cb4-3e1f-34e6-8356-a24fcbb7b274",
                                        "entry_id": "4a2d3e8a-a0a5-3ff3-8953-de100ff192ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To load a file into a software application from another version or system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a8792df-0da0-455a-a368-23b164b47305",
                                                "sense_id": "56028cb4-3e1f-34e6-8356-a24fcbb7b274",
                                                "text": "How can I import files from older versions of this application?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "import",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cac9a8ec-de86-3069-b621-2338d561de6a",
                                        "entry_id": "ff850420-ee4e-3fac-9270-cf57278722ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be important; to be significant; to be of consequence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a4633be-7bdd-47a5-95e3-23202a35fd2a",
                                                "sense_id": "cac9a8ec-de86-3069-b621-2338d561de6a",
                                                "text": "See how much it importeth to learn to take Time by the Fore-Top."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da816422-0d29-3aad-ac9c-978510770fab",
                                        "entry_id": "ff850420-ee4e-3fac-9270-cf57278722ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be of importance to (someone or something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06e0ebb6-aec8-4a06-8ede-93c7ca8af589",
                                                "sense_id": "da816422-0d29-3aad-ac9c-978510770fab",
                                                "text": "This Letter is mistooke: it importeth none here: It is writ to laquenetta."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23e94820-539e-4afe-99a5-006cd4a4265a",
                                                "sense_id": "da816422-0d29-3aad-ac9c-978510770fab",
                                                "text": "If I endure it, what imports it you?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7589d1fd-a659-36b8-a41f-6d40b2a32a7b",
                                        "entry_id": "ff850420-ee4e-3fac-9270-cf57278722ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be incumbent on (someone to do something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f8345a9-5f90-4346-93be-e7ce9f33a6c3",
                                                "sense_id": "7589d1fd-a659-36b8-a41f-6d40b2a32a7b",
                                                "text": "It imports us to get all the aid and assistance we can."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55928440-59b5-3517-b9a5-2f676d4b1612",
                                        "entry_id": "ff850420-ee4e-3fac-9270-cf57278722ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be important or crucial to (that something happen)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97703955-64cc-4d5f-b32c-2b759f3b9eb1",
                                                "sense_id": "55928440-59b5-3517-b9a5-2f676d4b1612",
                                                "text": "It much imports your house That all should be made clear."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "856f9e6e-89bd-33dc-b402-526f8106118c",
                                        "entry_id": "ff850420-ee4e-3fac-9270-cf57278722ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To mean, signify."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1add78ba-fa1c-4d7c-9f32-d8ecacc12e02",
                                                "sense_id": "856f9e6e-89bd-33dc-b402-526f8106118c",
                                                "text": "Every petition […] doth […] always import a multitude of speakers together."
